Block N (prereg v2 §3): LightRAG native adapter (lightrag-hku 1.5.7): one document per source object keyed by object_id, a revision is delete then insert (the library drops re-inserted ids), deletes purge and rebuild entities and relations from surviving chunks as the library does; mix query mode (library default), one store per process, metering through the library's token tracker, tiktoken file cached under cache/tiktoken; pinned install file

